    "content": "WRESTLE BOX 1-14-24\n\n January 13, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: Sports \n \n 275\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n Girls High School WrestlingFriday's Matches\nQueen Anne's 48, Winters Mill 36\n100: Michael (QA) p. Tate, 4:21; 105: Hresko (WM) p. Molina, 0:47; 110: Conley (QA) p. Ireland, 1:19; 115: Padilla (WM) p. Branham, 1:03; 120: Conard (QA) p. Shropshire, 2:28; 125: Patchett (QA) p. Scholl, 1:22; 130: Gray (QA) p. Smith, 1:21; 135: Vail (QA) p. Morley, 3:38; 140: Corcoran (QA) p. Goodwin, 3:22; 145: Harrid (WM) p. Hammond, 0:48; 155: McLeod (WM) p. Morris, 0 34; 165: Sweet (WM) p. Dickens, 0:39; 190: Bryant (QA) p. Tolle, 1:53; 235: Love (WM) p. Rooney, 0:19.\nBoys High School Wrestling\nQueen Anne's 42, Winters Mill 34\n126: Jackson (QA) tech fall Martin, 16-1; 132: Conley (QA) p. Heard, 1:29; 138: Mast (QA) p. Vasquez, 3:49; 144: Buchman (WM) maj. d. Ryan, 11-0; 150: Gaeng (WM) won by fft.; 157: Acevedo (WM) won by fft.; 165: Borkowski (WM) p. Niesz, 1:55; 175: Blackwell (QA) p. Brillhart, 1:24; 190: Wheaton (QA) d. Pawley, 6-2; 215: Greene (QA) won by fft.; 285: Richmond (WM) p. Sutton, 4:47; 106: H. Johnston (QA) won by fft.; 113: McDonald (QA) maj. d. Kiler, 10-0; 120: Wesmer (WM) p. M. Johnston, 1:12.\nSouthern 42, Queen Anne's 33\n132: Conley (QA) p. Quinterras, 4:53; 138: Ruel (SOU) p. Turner, 0:47; 144: Kressly (SOU) d. Ryan, 6-4; 150: Thurston (SOU) won by fft.; 157: Guy (SOU) won by fft.; 165: Greer (SOU) p. Niesz, 3:21; 175: Blackwell (QA) p. Heinrichs, 3:36; 215: Flores (SOU) d. Greene, 8-4; 285: Sutton (QA) p. Perkins, 3:01; 106: Mahoney (SOU) p. H. Johnston, 0:15; 113: M. Johnston (QA) p. Whitman, 0:46; 120: 120: McDonald (QA) d. Gladwell, 7-2; 126: Jackson (QA) won by fft. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
