  {
    "title": "WRESTLE BOX 2-2-24",
    "date": "2024-02-01",
    "author": "Bill Haufe",
    "content": "WRESTLE BOX 2-2-24\n\n February 1, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: Sports \n \n 193\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n High School WrestlingWednesday's Matches\nStephen Decatur 44, Kent Island 23\n113: Hinojosa (STD) p. R. Martinez, 3:33; 120: Hugues (STDE) p. Motto, 0:50; 126: Caimi (STD) p. S. Martinez, 3:24; 132: Brobst (KI) d. August, SV-1 3-1; 138: Couch (KI) maj. d. Saullo, 9-1; 144: Sandefer (KI) maj. d Riehl, 12-3; 150: Main (KI) d. Bell, 10-3; 157: Manuel (STD) maj. d. Adler, 16-8; 165: Intrieri (STD) p. Kougoures, 0:46 ; 175: Solito (STD) maj. d. Mellinger, 9-1; 190: Kohut (STD) p. Potter, 1:49; 215: McDaniel (STD) p. Morey, 5:32; 285: Coffey (KI) d. Hill, 4-2; 106: Lindner (KI) p. Archer, 3:08.\nKent Island 52 Harford Tech 19\n120: Little (HT) d. Motto, 8-6; 126: Moore (HT) maj. d. S. Martinez, 10-2; 132: Brobst (KI) maj. d. Donlick, 13-3; 138: Couch (KI) p. McNamee, 3:07; 144: Sandefer (KI) d. Chervak, 7-3; 150: Sewell (HT) p. Main, 3:51; 157: Adler (KI) p. Santiago, 3:36; 165: Kougoures (KI) p. Vickers, 0:46; 175: Mellinger (KI) d. Outlaw, 6-2; 190: Potter (KI) p. Ryder, 2:49; 215: Morey (KI) p. Terry, 1:19; 285: Coffey (KI) p. Seifert, 0:30; 106: Lindner (KI) p. Pruski, 1:14; 113: Tablan (HT) p. R. Martinez, 2:54. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
