    "content": "GIRLS WRESTLE AGATE 2-25-24\n\n February 23, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: Sports \n \n 183\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n LoCAL STANDINGSGirls High School Wrestling\nFriday's Matches\n2A-1A East Regional Championships\n(at Queen Anne's County High, Centreville)\nChampionship Finals\n100: Conley (QA) p. Newton (PKS), 1:20; 105: Olivas (HDG) p. Swann (CR), 0:16; 110: Birth (HDG) p. Nuttall (WIC), 3:45; 115: Conard (QA) p. Davis (PKS), 4:29; 120: Mellinger (KI) p. Price (QA), 1:25; 125: Patchett (QA) d. Plata (STD), 13-9; 130: Woodgeard (PKS) p. Gray (QA), 2:38; 135: Corcoran (QA) p. Mejber (STD), 3:45; 140: Ward (HDG) p. Reburn (QA), 4:27; 145: Coffey (KI) d. Hammond (QA), 5-2; 155: Farr (RS) p. Purnell (STD), 5:12; 170: Bernier (STD) p. Morris (QA), 0:56; 190: Johnson (STD) p. Bryant (QA), 0:14; 235: Porter (CR) p. Mitchell (CSD), 0:29.\nConsolation Finals\n100: None; 105: Ruiz (STD) p. Michael, 3:08; 110: Infante-Reyes (CR) p. Ashley-Pinder (KC), 4:44; 115: Hamill (PV) p. Edwards (WIC), 4:06; 120: Aguiar (CR) p. Garcia (STD), 0:59; 125: Dorleans (CR) p. Horsey (JMB), 2:35; 130: Morales (CR) bye; 135; None; 140: None; 145: Wockenfuss (HVT) d. Kefauver (CR), 8-5; 155: McGregor (CR) p. Dickens (QA), 3:46; 170: Jeanty (CR) bye; 190: Filip (HVT) bye; 235: Rooney (QA) bye. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
