    "content": "Newcomb paces Colonel in opener\n\n March 21, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: News \n \n 75\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n SNOW HILL — Makayla Newcomb pitched a three-hitter Thursday, fanning seven, walking none, and allowing one earned run, as Colonel Richardson High's softball team opened its season with a 14-1 rout of Snow Hill.Kylie Rhinehardt (2 for 2) had two RBIs and scored three runs for the Colonels. Eileen Johnson had a double and one RBI, Tyla Dickerson and Montana Davis each had a hit and two RBIs, and Sadie Prettyman had a hit. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
