  {
    "title": "Losing is tough",
    "date": "2024-03-24",
    "author": "Staff Writer",
    "content": "Losing is tough\n\n March 24, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Staff Writer | Section: Editors Inbox \n \n 86\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n Congratulations to the boys basketball 1A state championship runners-up Cambridge South Dorchester.Been watching some of these kids since their parks and rec days and am very proud of their accomplishments this season.\nUnfortunately in the photo of the players holding the finalist trophy (Sunday, March 17) they look so dejected. … Heads up, guys, great job. Losing is tough, but this season and that gritty final game leaves y'all respected.\nBest of luck in the future, I'll be looking for you playing college hoops.\nJON HALLBAUER\nEast New Market \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
