  {
    "title": "Shoutout to Dee Fisher",
    "date": "2024-06-02",
    "author": "Staff Writer",
    "content": "Shoutout to Dee Fisher\n\n June 2, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Staff Writer | Section: Editors Inbox \n \n 127\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n I'd like to give a shoutout to North Caroline High School tennis coach Dee Fisher. Congrats on winning the Bayside title.I remember teaching Dee the skills of the trade early on as he was starting out as a coach. As a teacher and lover of the game myself, I recognized his passion and dedication to the sport and his influence on kids.\nBut what I have always admired about Coach Fisher all these years is his \"no-cut\" policy. While other high schools turn young kids away from this beautiful sport, Dee Fisher believed everyone has a chance to grow mentally and physically on the tennis court.\nI also love that Coach Fisher emphasizes having fun.\nMy hat goes off to you, Dee Fisher. Keep up the good work.\nSUSAN CLAGGETT\nEaston \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
