    "title": "Alexander's 13 saves lift QA's",
    "date": "2024-09-19",
    "author": "Bill Haufe",
    "content": "Alexander's 13 saves lift QA's\n\n September 19, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: News \n \n 39\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n CENTREVILLE — Cassidy Alexander logged 13 saves Thursday, helping Queen Anne's County High's field hockey to a 2-0 shutout of Stephen Decatur.Queen Anne's Haley Cole scored the game's only goals off a pair of assists from Jordan Bilbo. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
