    "author": "Bill Haufe",
    "content": "QA's tops Holly Grove\n\n October 17, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: News \n \n 29\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n WESTOVER — Jordan Bilbo, Jamie Baldwin and Ella Rebstock each scored a goal Thursday, as Queen Anne's County High's field hockey team earned a 3-0 win over Holly Grove. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
