  {
    "title": "Ennals, Pinder lead Cambridge-SD romp",
    "date": "2024-12-06",
    "author": "Bill Haufe",
    "content": "Ennals, Pinder lead Cambridge-SD romp\n\n December 6, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: News \n \n 54\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n CRISFIELD — Koby Ennals scored 22 points and Semaj Pinder finished with 21 Thursday, as Cambridge-South Dorchester High's boys basketball team opened its season with a 82-32 rout of Crisfield.Sterling Perkins Jr. added nine points for the Vikings, the defending Bayside Conference champions who reached the Class 1A state title game last season. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
