    "date": "2024-12-06",
    "author": "Bill Haufe",
    "content": "CSD's Todd surpasses 1,000 career points\n\n December 6, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: News \n \n 70\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n CAMBRIDGE — Senior Le'Asia Todd scored 21 points to surpass the 1,000-career-point milestone Thursday night while leading Cambridge-South Dorchester High's girls basketball team to a 73-10 victory over Crisfield in the season-opener for both teams.Todd added 10 rebounds and three steals. The Vikings were also led by Destiny Johnson, who netted 19 points, seven rebounds and six assists, and Tejanae Ballin, who finished with 16 points and four steals. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
