    "content": "Thomas' 14 points power Kent Island\n\n December 6, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: News \n \n 44\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n SALISBURY — Sophomore Makayla Thomas scored a team-high 14 points Thursday, as Kent Island High's girls basketball team opened its season with a 56-52 victory over host James M. Bennett.Armani Black had 13 points for the Buccaneers and senior Sydney Riska scored 12. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
